   - Formula: pressureForce = -dir * mass * (pi->pressure + pj->pressure) / (2 * pj->density) * spikyGrad * pow(h - dist, 2)

2. Viscosity force:
   - Based on velocity difference (pj->velocity - pi->velocity)
   - Magnitude: viscosity * mass * (velocityDif / pj->density) * spikyLap * (h - dist)
